===============================================================================
1. beast itself — MIT
===============================================================================

Applies to `bin/`, `lib/`, `scripts/`, `test/`, the nine original skills
(route, frontend, code, writing, motion, performance, security, growth, media),
the BEAST system prompts, and the policy files.

