===============================================================================
2. Vendored skills — NOT covered by the above
===============================================================================

`home/agents/skills/` and `home/agents/skill-modules/` contain skills authored
by other people and vendored into this repository. The MIT grant above does NOT
extend to them. Each retains its own upstream license, and several ship their
own LICENSE or NOTICE file inside their directory.

See NOTICE.md for per-upstream attribution.

Two known problems, stated rather than hidden:

  * A number of shipped modules currently have NO recorded provenance. Their
    license is unknown. `npm run notice` lists them and exits non-zero. This
    repository is not fit for public redistribution until that list is empty.

  * Several modules declare a license in their frontmatter while shipping no
    corresponding license text. NOTICE.md enumerates these.

Assets whose terms explicitly forbid redistribution have been removed rather
than vendored (GSAP; the Cyberpunk 2077 fankit). See NOTICE.md.

If you are an upstream author and want your work removed or credited
differently, open an issue.
